WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.159 --> 00:00:01.473
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

2
00:00:03.801 --> 00:00:09.930
<v><b>Satnav:</b></v> After 100 metres, turn right. Turn right.

3
00:00:10.069 --> 00:00:13.034
<v><b>Lisa:</b></v> Don’t turn left! Turn right!

4
00:00:13.193 --> 00:00:15.482
<v><b>Mel:</b></v> It’s left, I’m sure.

5
00:00:15.681 --> 00:00:17.084
<v><b>Lisa:</b></v> No, it isn’t.

6
00:00:17.193 --> 00:00:18.785
<v><b>Mel:</b></v> Yes, it is!

7
00:00:18.815 --> 00:00:21.889
<v><b>Lisa:</b></v> No, it isn’t! This is wrong!

8
00:00:26.188 --> 00:00:27.053
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

9
00:00:30.347 --> 00:00:32.834
<v><b>Lisa:</b></v> I’m thirsty. Where’s the water?

10
00:00:33.113 --> 00:00:35.898
<v><b>Mel:</b></v> Sorry, it’s empty.

11
00:00:36.535 --> 00:00:37.530
<v><b>Lisa:</b></v> Empty?

12
00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:47.480
<v><b>Mel:</b></v> Yes, empty. I’m hungry. And Alfie’s hungry. Let’s stop at a café.

13
00:00:47.878 --> 00:00:49.669
<v><b>Lisa:</b></v> OK, good idea.

14
00:00:56.076 --> 00:00:57.270
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

15
00:01:05.648 --> 00:01:07.061
<v><b>Mel:</b></v> Brr…

16
00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:08.394
<v><b>Lisa:</b></v> What’s the matter?

17
00:01:09.051 --> 00:01:12.951
<v><b>Mel:</b></v> I’m cold. Can you close your window?

18
00:01:13.558 --> 00:01:15.259
<v><b>Lisa:</b></v> I’m not cold! I’m hot!

19
00:01:15.468 --> 00:01:19.806
<v><b>Mel:</b></v> Well, I’m cold. And Alfie’s cold.

20
00:01:20.234 --> 00:01:21.170
<v><b>Lisa:</b></v> OK.

21
00:01:24.115 --> 00:01:28.910
<v><b>Mel:</b></v> And please don’t drive fast! It’s really dangerous.

22
00:01:29.050 --> 00:01:31.338
<v><b>Lisa:</b></v> It’s fine. Don’t worry!

23
00:01:31.935 --> 00:01:33.348
<v><b>Mel:</b></v> Be careful!

24
00:01:37.905 --> 00:01:38.920
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

25
00:01:41.765 --> 00:01:44.591
<v><b>Lisa:</b></v> It’s late. Let’s look for a hotel.

26
00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:47.695
<v><b>Mel:</b></v> Oh, let’s not stop now.

27
00:01:47.735 --> 00:01:52.292
<v><b>Lisa:</b></v> I’m tired and it’s dark. And Alfie’s tired, too.

28
00:01:52.332 --> 00:01:57.983
<v><b>Mel:</b></v> OK, OK. Look for a hotel near here.

29
00:02:00.929 --> 00:02:04.172
<v><b>Lisa:</b></v> The Highland Hotel’s 20 miles from here.

30
00:02:04.252 --> 00:02:08.072
<v><b>Mel:</b></v> Fine, no problem. Let’s go there.